cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use these experiment programs in academic work, please cite the thesis below and this repository."
title: "Loot Box 抽卡行为实验程序集 (Loot Box Experiment Programs: Flappy Bird + gacha task)"
abstract: >-
  Four Qt 5 (C++) implementations of a Flappy Bird + loot-box card-drawing behavioural task.
  Study 1 manipulates whether the draw reward is fixed or random (curiosity motivation);
  Study 2 manipulates the value of the rare reward (CNY 0.5 vs CNY 3; wanting motivation).
  Each program logs draw count, pipe score and (when extended) play duration to a text file.
